      "id": "claim_d27a3c183a5a44abb87fba4769e988d0",
      "statement": "A thread ID printed by one run only continues correctly against the same data/threads.db file, because main.py's SqliteSaver/SqliteStore pair persists the thread's checkpointed State keyed by thread_id in that single SQLite file, and graph.py's Studio-served graph object is compiled without this checkpointer at all.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://graph.py#L1-L9",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c2288c02950251fea3e1f233da838cacf260566c8829987fda90da7d7028ca30:"
        },
        {
