    {
      "id": "claim_412da0969cdc405889f5a071bce3eee4",
      "statement": "main.py requires --thread whenever a follow-up question argument is given, and builds the follow-up's graph input as {\"messages\": [...]} (vs. {\"as_of\": date} for a fresh run), invoked as `uv run main.py --thread ID \"question\"`.",
