    {
      "id": "claim_3f61487ce848477b8c0c251a1606b2dc",
      "statement": "The 7-day findings-memory recall (research.py's recall(), reading the LangGraph store) only runs in the new-report branch of the research node; a follow-up's research call skips recall entirely and relies only on the thread's own state.findings topics carried into the single new topic string.",
