    {
      "id": "claim_125e474962ed4b32b733c5a70cfae494",
      "statement": "Because State.findings and State.sources have no custom reducer, a follow-up's research node overwrites them: state.findings becomes the single new Finding for the follow-up question and state.sources becomes only the articles that follow-up's searches returned, replacing (not merging with) the prior run's values; verify and price then replace state.rejected and state.moves accordingly for this new findings/sources pair.",
